## Troubleshooting

### Backend can't read .env:
```bash
# Ensure .env is in project root
ls -la .env

# Check godotenv import
import "github.com/joho/godotenv"
```

### Frontend env vars not working:
```bash
# Ensure VITE_ prefix
VITE_API_URL=...  # ✅ Works
API_URL=...       # ❌ Won't work

# Rebuild after changing .env
pnpm dev
```

### Database connection fails:
```bash
# Verify .env values
cat .env | grep POSTGRES

# Test connection
psql -h localhost -U postgres -d decm
```

